  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add beef and cook until browned, about 3-4 minutes. Remove from pan and set aside.",
    "Add onion, garlic, and ginger to the pan and cook until onion is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add curry powder and garam masala to the pan and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in coconut milk and tomato. Bring to a simmer.",
